<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka June 1997 tea production 26.4 mln kg.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka June 1997 tea production 26.4 mln kg.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's state Tea Board said on Monday the country produced approximately 26.4 million kg of black tea in June, down slightly from 27.37 million kg in May.</p>
<p>Tea Board chairman Clifford Ratwatte told Reuters the June figure was provisional and the final output figures would be published at the end of the month.</p>
<p>He gave no comparative figures for June 1996.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
